Package: validity-rs-archive-keyring
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: all
Maintainer: validity-rs maintainers <409744+pierre-warnier@users.noreply.github.com>
Section: misc
Priority: optional
Multi-Arch: foreign
Homepage: https://github.com/validity-rs/validity-rs
Description: OpenPGP key and APT source of the validity-rs repository
 Installs the key that signs the validity-rs APT repository, in its own
 keyring (trusted for that repository only, through Signed-By), the APT
 source of the repository, and an unattended-upgrades setting that lets
 automatic updates come from it. Upgrades of this package carry key
 rotations.
